DISCLAIMER FOR ENGINEERING USE

This software performs model-level constraint auditing. It does not replace
finite-element simulation, thermal measurement, or any form of physical
validation. Every PASS produced by it is a conclusion about a model, not about
a real machine. Do not use it as the sole basis for a safety-critical design
decision.
